    "weights_once": "the second context's RSS increase is below half the file bytes, and RSS/Metal stay within the max (a second copy of the weights exceeds it)",
    "ownership": "wrapper live allocations/bytes constant per request and exactly 0 after every context close (reset, final) and before the model closes",
    "metal_context_retention_bytes": 67108864,
    "growth_bytes": 67108864,
    "retention_checks": "Metal provider bytes after the final context close at most 64 MiB above the value before the first context opened; RSS after the final context close at most 64 MiB above RSS after the reset close (no growth across context create/destroy); model-closed RSS of cycle 3 at most 64 MiB above cycle 1 (in-process cycles only); RSS retained after a context close is reported, not gated",
